\par
asthma attack (\$10/case), a child's lower respiratory
\par
disease (\$75/case), and chronic respiratory disease
\par
(\$250/case). They also estimated the cost of ecolog-
\par
ical damage (\$0.015 per pound of sulfur emitted), and
\par
esthetic effects (\$0.034 per pound of sulfur emissions),
